This system will be a micro service architecture based system.
The small to medium ecommerce business owners will use it. Multi tenant based ecommerce site.
People who are involved in online business in facebook will use it.
Each of the tenants will have individual URL for their ecommerce site.
They will have inventory management along with their ecommerce portal.

Mainly there will be 3 web portals
1. System Admin Portal
2. Shop Admin Portal for individual tenants.
3. E-commerce site (for each tenant unique URL will be given)
